This derivative has a separate executable, desktop entry, application ID and
configuration namespace. Icon preparation and theme-aware frames were added;
rendering arguments and unused upstream paths were simplified. Original copyright
notices are retained in the source. This distribution contains only the App List
component and its translations, rather than the full cosmic-applets workspace.
